# 1. Architecture Overview

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                          LANDING LAYER                                 │
│  /Volumes/workspace/retail_landing/raw_data/                          │
│  9 CSV files downloaded from Kaggle (Olist Brazilian E-Commerce)      │
└────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │ spark.read.csv → .saveAsTable()
                         ▼
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                          BRONZE LAYER                                  │
│  Schema: workspace.bronze                                              │
│  9 Delta tables (raw data + _ingestion_timestamp + _source_file)      │
└────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │ Type casting, composite key dedup, joins
                         ▼
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                          SILVER LAYER                                  │
│  Schema: workspace.silver                                              │
│  8 Delta tables (cleaned, typed, deduplicated)                        │
└────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │ Joins, aggregations, formatting, COALESCE keys
                         ▼
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                          GOLD LAYER                                    │
│  Schema: workspace.gold                                                │
│  8 tables: fact_orders, fact_payments, daily_sales_summary,           │
│            dim_date, dim_sellers, dim_customer, dim_product,         │
│            dim_order_status                                            │
│  Optimizations: OPTIMIZE ... ZORDER BY + ANALYZE TABLE                 │
└────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │ Automated validations & thresholds
                         ▼
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     QUALITY CHECKS LAYER                               │
│  Notebook: 04_quality_checks                                           │
│  Tests: PK Uniqueness, Nulls, FK Integrity, Ranges, Row Thresholds    │
└────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │ Import
                         ▼
                     Power BI Desktop
```

**Notebooks:**
- `00_setup` — Kaggle download + Volume storage
- `01_bronze` — CSV → Delta ingestion
- `02_silver` — Cleaning & transformation (composite key dedup)
- `03_gold` — Business-ready tables + Delta Optimizations (OPTIMIZE + ZORDER)
- `04_quality_checks` — Automated data quality validations & assertions

**Orchestration:** Databricks Workflow `Retail_Nightly_Pipeline` (5 sequential tasks)

