# 3. Gold Table Schemas

## `workspace.gold.fact_orders`

| Column | Data Type | Nullable | Source | Business Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| order_id | string | No | silver.orders | Unique order identifier | `e481f51cbdc54678b7cc49136f2d6af7` |
| order_item_id | integer | No | COALESCE(i.order_item_id, 0) | Item sequence within order (0 for no items) | `1`, `2`, `0` |
| customer_id | string | No | silver.orders | Customer-order mapping ID | `9ef432eb6251297304e76186b10a928d` |
| customer_unique_id | string | No | silver.customers | True unique customer identifier | `7c396fd4830fd04220f754e42b4e5bff` |
| order_status | string | No | silver.orders | Current order status | `delivered`, `shipped`, `canceled` |
| order_purchase_timestamp | timestamp | No | silver.orders | Full purchase timestamp | `2017-10-02 10:56:33` |
| order_purchase_date | date | No | CAST(timestamp AS DATE) | Order date (dim_date join key) | `2017-10-02` |
| order_approved_at | timestamp | Yes | silver.orders | When payment was approved | `2017-10-02 11:07:15` |
| order_delivered_customer_date | timestamp | Yes | silver.orders | When customer received delivery | `2017-10-11 18:00:00` |
| order_estimated_delivery_date | timestamp | Yes | silver.orders | Estimated delivery date | `2017-10-20 00:00:00` |
| customer_city | string | No | silver.customers | Customer's city (Initcap) | `Sao Paulo` |
| customer_state | string | No | silver.customers | Customer's state (2-letter code) | `SP`, `RJ`, `MG` |
| product_id | string | Yes | silver.order_items | Product identifier | `87c1f2c0fa0ba3ad7e27a4082e2aab7b` |
| seller_id | string | Yes | silver.order_items | Seller identifier | `48436dade18ac8b2bce089ec2a041c71` |
| product_category | string | Yes | silver.products | English category (formatted) | `Health Beauty`, `Watches Gifts` |
| price | double | Yes | silver.order_items | Item sale price in BRL | `29.99`, `149.90` |
| freight_value | double | Yes | silver.order_items | Shipping cost in BRL | `8.72`, `15.10` |
| delivery_days | integer | Yes | Calculated | Days from purchase to delivery | `7`, `15`, `null` |
| is_late_delivery | boolean | Yes | Calculated | Whether delivery was late | `true`, `false` |

**Primary Key:** `(order_id, order_item_id)` — composite (`order_item_id` defaults to 0 via COALESCE)  
**Foreign Keys:** `customer_unique_id` → dim_customer, `product_id` → dim_product, `seller_id` → dim_sellers, `order_purchase_date` → dim_date, `order_status` → dim_order_status

